{
  "title": "ISic000175. Epitaph for Aulus Fabricius",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>ḶC̣AṢṢ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Aulus · Fabricius · Auli · filius\n                    Primus\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Aulus\"><span data-text=\"Aulus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"\">A(ulus)</span></span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fabricius\"><span data-text=\"Fabricius\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"\">Fabricius</span></span> · <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Auli\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Auli\"><span data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"\">A(uli)</span></span></span> · <span data-text=\"filius\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"\">f(ilius)</span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Primus\"><span data-text=\"Primus\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"\">Primus</span></span></span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Postumia\n                    Fausta\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Postumia\"><span data-text=\"Postumia\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"\">Postumia</span></span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fausta\"><span data-text=\"Fausta\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"\">Fausta</span></span></span>  <br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Fabricia\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fabricia\"><span data-text=\"Fabricia\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"\">Fabricia</span></span></span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>..A..[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Aulus · Fabricius · Auli · filius\n                    Primus\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Aulus\"><span data-text=\"Aulus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"\">A</span></span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fabricius\"><span data-text=\"Fabricius\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"\">FABRICIUS</span></span>·<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Auli\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Auli\"><span data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"\">A</span></span></span>·<span data-text=\"filius\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"\">F</span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Primus\"><span data-text=\"Primus\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"\">PRIMUS</span></span></span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Postumia\n                    Fausta\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Postumia\"><span data-text=\"Postumia\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"\">POSTUMIA</span></span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fausta\"><span data-text=\"Fausta\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"\">FAUSTA</span></span></span><br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Fabricia\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fabricia\"><span data-text=\"Fabricia\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"\">FABRICIA</span></span></span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000175_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2023-07-04.\" src=\"ISic000175_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000175.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2023-07-04.\" src=\"ISic000175-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic000175_rear_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2023-07-04.\" src=\"ISic000175_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000175_rear.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2023-07-04.\" src=\"ISic000175_rear-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text from autopsy</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"1\">1: <span>Mommsen: LCAS[---]; Bivona: [---]a[---]; the traces are compatible with L·CASS[ius], and assuming the compression implied by the 'SS', a complete personal name with short cognoment on line 1; initial P might also be possible.</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Lucius Cassius(?) [---], Aulus Fabricius Primus, son of Aulus, Postumia Fausta, Fabricia</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Bivona makes no reference to the traces in line 1 in discussion; she suggests that the female names in lines 4-6 resolve as two individuals, Postumia Fausta and Fabricia, but clearly other permutations are possible. The traces in line 1 seem most compatible with another male personal name in the nominative, rather than any sort of heading.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li> Castelli 1784 331 no.2 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\" target=\"_blank\">7404</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Bivona 1994 97 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002137\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002137</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>Rather crudely cut tall and narrow letters (note the quality of the stone), with rounded channels, and very basic interpuncts. Attempted serif on e.g. the initial F of line 5, but otherwise plain.</p> Line 1  greater than 3(max 50)  Line 2  43-51  Line 3  28-36  Line 4  35-46  Line 5  41-53  Line 6  51-60  Interlineation line 1 to 2  15  Interlineation line 2 to 3  9  Interlineation line 3 to 4  11-15  Interlineation line 4 to 5  7-21  Interlineation line 5 to 6  0-16  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
